<title>UK: M. Y. Holdings year pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>M. Y. Holdings year pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending August 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)(adjusted)  6.67		   vs 5.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.7		    vs 1.4</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 2.4		    vs 2.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     12.6		   vs 9.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   86.8		   vs 77.1</p>
<p> Operating result	 12.55		  vs 9.21</p>
<p> Interest		   0.06 receivable    vs 0.22 payable</p>
<p> Tax			  3.59		   vs 2.30</p>
<p> Retained profit	  5.78		   vs 4.75</p>
<p> Pay date		   January 27</p>
<p>Div registration date  December 24  Ex-div date		December 16</p>
<p>Note - Packaging manufacturer M.Y. Holdings Plc chief executive John Monks said in a statement that trading this year had already exceeded expectations.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
